<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED AT SPFB.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED AT SPFB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>All but one Helibor interest</p>
<p>rates were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Wednesday. The three-month rate was flat at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			  March 5 fix	  March 4 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.07 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.16 pct		3.17 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.26 pct		3.26 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.35 pct		3.35 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
